# The project is developed on Windows and deployed on Linux. Everything here is
# checked out with LF endings: a shell script or a systemd unit with CRLF fails
# on the server ("bad interpreter"), and Python source stays consistent either
# way.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
